---
title: "Booking DB status and paid state"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: No booking
  s1: accepted, unpaid
  s2: cancelled, unpaid
  s3: rejected, unpaid
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: booker submits valid request
  s1 --> s2: save cancelled status
  s2 --> s3: authorized host rejects
  s2 --> s1: reschedule transaction cancels original and creates replacement or save accepted status and references
  s3 --> s1: reschedule transaction cancels original and creates replacement or save accepted status and references
  s3 --> s2: save cancelled status
